<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>About | Weisburg</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body class="home-body">

  <%- include("partials/nav") %>

  <main class="about-page">

    <section class="about-intro">

      <div class="about-header">
        <h1>Hi, I'm Connor</h1>
        <p class="tagline">
          A creative exploring music, systems, and storytelling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content">

        <div class="about-photo">
          <img
            src="/images/Photo_4.jpg"
            alt="Connor Weisburg"
            class="profile-photo"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="about-text">

          <section class="card green-card">
            <h2>My Story</h2>

            <p>
              I grew up in Colorado, dreaming of being a cowboy. I was a scrappy kid who became obsessed with music, puzzles, and stories. After recieving a bachelor's degree in Mathematics at CU Boulder, I held an artist residency at the Oakley Art House, and I eventually chased those obsessions west to Los Angeles, where I currently reside. 
            </p>

          </section>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>
    <section class="card blue-card">

            <h2>Values</h2>

            <p>
              I value depth over speed, consistency over intensity, and intention over reaction.
            </p>

            <p>
              Do what you must do and do it well.
            </p>

          </section>
    <section class="card brown-card">

      <h2>Snapshots</h2>

      <div class="snapshot-grid">

        <div class="snapshot">
          <img src="/images/photo_2.JPG" alt="Photo 2">
        </div>

        <div class="snapshot">
          <img src="/images/Sunglasses_suit.png" alt="Connor in suit">
        </div>

        <div class="snapshot">
          <img src="/images/self_bass_studio.png" alt="Bass studio">
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="card accent-card">

      <h2>Philosophy</h2>

      <p>
        There are secret codes and symbols out here. Hidden messages wrapped in sacred geometry and buried beneath forgotten melodies. There are one thousand epiphanies waiting to be unlocked with the right key. My purpose is to uncover the wonder that has been lost.
      </p>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>